<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us | SNPN</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    
    <style>
        /* Enhanced Page Header with Background Image Overlay */
        .page-header {
            background-color: #0A2F5D; 
            /* Updated to use a local relative path */
            background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(10, 47, 93, 0.85), rgba(10, 47, 93, 0.95)), url('/images/about-hero-bg.jpg');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 80px 10%;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: inset 0 -10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .page-header h1 {
            color: #ffffff; 
            font-size: 42px;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .page-header p {
            color: #CBD5E1; 
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 500;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .about-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 60px auto;
            padding: 0 5%;
        }

        /* Modern Split Layout for Text and Images */
        .split-section {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 50px;
            margin-bottom: 80px;
        }

        .split-section.reverse {
            flex-direction: row-reverse;
        }

        .split-content {
            flex: 1;
        }

        .split-image-wrapper {
            flex: 1;
            position: relative;
        }

        .split-image {
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .split-image:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        /* Decorative background accent behind images */
        .split-image-wrapper::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -15px;
            left: -15px;
            right: 15px;
            bottom: 15px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-brand, #2563EB), #0A2F5D);
            border-radius: 16px;
            z-index: -1;
            opacity: 0.15;
        }

        .split-section.reverse .split-image-wrapper::before {
            left: 15px;
            right: -15px;
        }

        .section-title {
            color: var(--primary-dark, #0F172A);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .section-title span {
            color: var(--accent-brand, #2563EB);
        }

        .about-text {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: var(--text-gray, #475569);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        /* Core Focus Grid */
        .focus-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 30px;
            margin-top: 60px;
        }

        .focus-card {
            background-color: var(--bg-white, #ffffff);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 35px 25px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: var(--card-shadow, 0 4px 20px -2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08));
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle, #E2E8F0);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .focus-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: var(--accent-brand, #2563EB);
        }

        .focus-icon {
            font-size: 40px;
            color: var(--accent-brand, #2563EB);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .focus-card h3 {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: var(--primary-dark, #0F172A);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .focus-card p {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-gray, #475569);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Responsive Design */
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .split-section, .split-section.reverse {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 40px;
            }
            .focus-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .focus-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .page-header h1 {
                font-size: 32px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <div class="page-header">
        <h1>About SNPN</h1>
        <p>Advancing Neuropeptide & Neuroendocrine Research in India</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-container">
        
        <!-- Section 1: Mission -->
        <div class="split-section">
            <div class="split-content">
                <h2 class="section-title">Our <span>Mission</span> & Vision</h2>
                <p class="about-text">The Society of Neuropeptides and Neuroendocrinology (SNPN) was established with a singular vision: to foster collaboration, ignite innovation, and support groundbreaking research in the fields of neuropeptides and neuroendocrinology across India and globally.</p>
                <p class="about-text">By providing a platform for both eminent scientists and emerging researchers, SNPN aims to facilitate the exchange of ideas, promote educational initiatives, and drive scientific inquiry that addresses crucial biological and medical challenges in neuroscience.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="split-image-wrapper">
                <!-- Updated to use a local relative path -->
                <img src="/images/About/mission-image.jpg" alt="Scientific Research Visualization" class="split-image">
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 2: What We Do (Reversed Layout) -->
        <div class="split-section reverse">
            <div class="split-content">
                <h2 class="section-title">Driving <span>Discovery</span></h2>
                <p class="about-text">We bridge the gap between foundational molecular biology and applied clinical neuroendocrinology. Our society acts as a catalyst for interdisciplinary studies, bringing together experts in genetics, molecular biology, and behavioral neuroscience.</p>
                <p class="about-text">Through annual symposiums, collaborative grants, and mentorship programs, we are building the next generation of scientific leaders equipped to decode the complex signaling pathways of the brain and endocrine systems.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="split-image-wrapper">
                <!-- Updated to use a local relative path -->
                <img src="/images/About/discovery-image.jpg" alt="Laboratory Research" class="split-image">
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 3: Core Pillars Grid -->
        <div class="focus-grid">
            <div class="focus-card">
                <i class="fas fa-network-wired focus-icon"></i>
                <h3>Global Collaboration</h3>
                <p>Connecting Indian researchers with leading neuroendocrine institutes worldwide to share methodologies and breakthroughs.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="focus-card">
                <i class="fas fa-microscope focus-icon"></i>
                <h3>Translational Research</h3>
                <p>Supporting projects that translate bench-side neuropeptide discoveries into tangible clinical and therapeutic applications.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="focus-card">
                <i class="fas fa-user-graduate focus-icon"></i>
                <h3>Mentorship</h3>
                <p>Providing specialized training, workshops, and networking opportunities for postgraduate students and early-career scientists.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>